nhancing our diagnostic and interventional capabilities.\nLearn More\nOur Internal Medicine Team is Growing!\nNow scheduling consultations Monday-Thursday. Dr. Bieberly's services will begin on Tuesday, September 1, 2026\nLearn More\nMISSION VETERINARY EMERGENCY & SPECIALTY\nBased in Mission, KS, Mission Veterinary Emergency & Specialty is the Kansas City area’s most trusted and longstanding 24-hour emergency and specialty animal hospital, providing veterinary specialty and emergency care to Mission, Overland Park, Kansas City, and the surrounding communities.\nNeurology\nSurgery\nInternal Medicine\nCardiology\nNeurology\nSurgery\nInternal Medicine\nCardiology\nNeurology\nSurgery\nInternal Medicine\nCardiology\nNeurology\nAnesthesia\nEmergency & Critical Care\nOncology\nAnesthesia\nEmergency & Critical Care\nOncology\nAnesthesia\nEmergency & Critical Care\nOncology\nAnesthesia\n24/7 Compassionate Care for Pets and Families\nWhen your pet has an emergency, every moment matters. Our dedicated team of emergency veterinarians, skilled technicians, and compassionate support staff is available 24\n/\n7 to provide essential, lifesaving care when your pet needs it most. Working closely with your family veterinarian, we act as an extension of specialized care to ensure comprehensive, coordinated care for your beloved companion.\nGive Us A Call\nPhone:\n(913) 722-5566\nFax:\n(913) 722-1890\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nClient Testimonials & Reviews\nAt Mission Veterinary Emergency and Specialty, we have been dedicated to providing our care to the community since 1993, and we strive to treat your pets with the same care and compassion as if they were our own.\nMission Veterinary Emergency & Specialty\n5914 Johnson Dr.\nMission\n,\nKS\n66202\nT:\n(913) 722-5566\nF:\n(913) 722-1890\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWe